Additional notice concerning third-party data:

The SPARC catalogue (Spitzer Photometry and Accurate Rotation Curves) used
by this software is publicly available and is subject to the terms of its
original publication:

    Lelli, F., McGaugh, S. S., & Schombert, J. M. 2016, AJ, 152, 157
    https://astroweb.cwru.edu/SPARC/

This software does not redistribute the SPARC catalogue; it downloads the
catalogue at runtime from its official source. Users of this software are
responsible for complying with any terms of use that the SPARC collaboration
may apply to the catalogue data.

If you use this software or the results it produces in scientific work,
please cite both the software (see CITATION.cff or the README) and the
SPARC catalogue paper above.
